---
description: Implement from approved OpenSpec tasks and keep specs aligned during execution
globs: ["src/**", "app/**", "services/**", "packages/**", "terraform/**", "infra/**", "jobs/**", "notebooks/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---

When working on an approved OpenSpec change:

- keep the active `openspec/changes/.../tasks.md` in context
- implement from the approved proposal, design, and task breakdown
- update task progress as implementation proceeds
- flag spec drift immediately if the implementation reveals that the design is wrong

Rules:

- Do not silently diverge from the approved spec.
- If code changes alter contracts, update the relevant spec or task artifacts in the same branch.
- If implementation changes workflow intent or behavior, update the relevant SDD in the same branch.
- If implementation changes requirements, validation rules, or interfaces, update the relevant SRS in the same branch.
- If the implementation forces a material design change, revise the spec before continuing.
